<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">This captures the key insight that LLM "memory" isn't mechanical storage (x ↦ x) but predictive re-encoding (x ↦ F(x)) that can bootstrap higher-order symbolic systems through stable transformations.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
