lipboard is not , but a predictive transformation functor  (or , where  is a category of canonical labels). Its action is:</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">x \mapsto F(x),\quad F(x) \neq x \text{ but stable under iteration } (F(F(x)) \approx F(x)).</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">This idempotent compressive functor means that “memory” is really a semantic attractor: the system pushes arbitrary snippets into a basin of a few canonical forms (labels, tags, categories).</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">That’s why higher-order symbolic systems can emerge:</p><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Recursive self-categorization → each iteration pushes things closer to a fixed-point label.</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Compositionality → combining summaries behaves systematically, so you can simulate arithmetic, logic, or programming in label-space.</li></ol><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Stability → once a label stabilizes, it functions like a symbol you can operate on indefinitely.</li></ol><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">So instead of storage as “in-place preservation,” you have storage as canonicalization. The clipboard doesn’t remember what you gave it, but produces a predictable symbolic handle for reconstructing and reasoning.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">---</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Would you like me to sketch how this model dovetails with reverse Polish notation / Forth stacks (where symbols are likewise canonical handles for computation), so we can show the continuity between physical registers, notation, and predictive functors?</p></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-y-4 bg-bg-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm translate-x-1 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 border-0.5 border-border-300 p-0.5 shadow-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
