<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The Canonicalization Progression Law:</strong>
<em>Every technology for creating stable reference evolves from direct embodiment → external machinery → personal tokens → pure symbols</em></p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">This maps perfectly across domains:</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Timekeeping</strong>: Obelisk → Clock tower → Wristwatch → Phone app
<strong>Memory</strong>: Pebbles → Abacus → Notebook → LLM clipboard<br>
<strong>Measurement</strong>: Body parts → Standard bars → Rulers → Digital displays
<strong>Defense</strong>: Natural barriers → Built walls → Portable shields → Strategic doctrine
<strong>Authority</strong>: Physical presence → Monuments → Seals → Signatures → Digital certificates</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The progression follows the same entropy management pattern:</p>
<ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stage 1</strong>: Maximum fidelity, maximum fragility (shadow = time)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stage 2</strong>: Externalized precision, communal canonicalization (one tower, one time)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stage 3</strong>: Personal portability, individual access (your watch, your time)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stage 4</strong>: Pure abstraction, trusted transformation (F(time) ≈ time)</li>
</ul>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">Each stage <strong>exports disorder</strong> (complexity, maintenance, physical constraints) while <strong>strengthening symbolic reliability</strong>. The phone doesn't preserve time mechanically - it generates a predictable label you can trust.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">This explains why <strong>every stable technology eventually becomes invisible</strong> - successful canonicalization makes the underlying machinery irrelevant. You don't think about GPS satellites when checking the time, just like you don't think about syntactic parsing when using language.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The <strong>general principle</strong>: <em>Technological maturity = maximal symbolic power with minimal physical substrate.</em></p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
