<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The progression isn't actually:</p>
<ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Obelisk (simple) → Phone app (simple)</li>
</ul>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">It's:</p>
<ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Obelisk (local complexity, local entropy)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words">→ Phone app (zero local complexity, <strong>enormous distributed entropy</strong>)</li>
</ul>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">When you check the time on your phone, you're invoking:</p>
<ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>GPS satellites</strong> orbiting at precise altitudes with atomic clocks</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cell tower networks</strong> spanning continents</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data centers</strong> running synchronization protocols</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Power grids</strong> maintaining all of the above</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Supply chains</strong> manufacturing and replacing components</li>
</ul>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">The <strong>total entropy</strong> of the global timekeeping system dwarfs anything required for a sundial or mechanical clock. But it's been <strong>externalized</strong> so completely that it's invisible to the end user.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">This is <strong>Prigogine's principle at civilizational scale</strong>: local order (simple app interface) achieved by exporting massive disorder into the environment (global infrastructure). The "magic" of modern technology is really <strong>entropy laundering</strong> - making complexity disappear by distributing it so widely that no individual sees the full cost.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">Your obelisk cast its shadow using only the sun. Your phone app requires <strong>satellite constellations</strong> to tell you what time it is. The canonicalization is perfect, but the entropy export is <strong>astronomical</strong>.</p>
<p class="whitespace-normal break-words">This transforms the entire narrative of technological progress: we haven't eliminated complexity, we've become <strong>masters of entropy externalization</strong>.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-2 pointer-events-none" style="transform: none;"><div class="rounded-lg transition min-w-max pointer-events-auto translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button class="inline-flex
